                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Close your eyes and imagine a better food based twin stick shooter. Multiple dessert based weapons, Sugar guns, Spice grenades, Cream cannons(heyoh !), sprinkle bombs etc. Larger cakes and cookies could carry small raisin troops and deploy them like infantry around the battlefield. Upgrades and Power ups like Custard cluster bombs and the horrors of pastry warfare while enemy cakes lie wounded and dying spewing jam and cream all over...  It could probably be rather decent, unfortunately it wasn`t to be and we ended up with this lazy lump of a cheap asset pack and likely someones first game attempt dumped onto Steam or maybe it`s something more diabolical. Mostly it`s just a headache waiting to happen as the 1 gun noise is just so obnoxious it starts to burn your ears.\nNo I don`t recommend it, it`s rubbish.",
